WEBVTT

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:00.256
And I kind of grew up assuming

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:03.040
everyone has some hidden,
amazing thing about them.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:06.560
And honestly, I think
it's what makes me a better host.

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:10.096
I keep my mouth shut
as often as I possibly can,

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.536
I keep my mind open,

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:14.056
and I'm always prepared to be amazed,

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:16.040
and I'm never disappointed.

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:18.616
You do the same thing.

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:21.056
Go out, talk to people,

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:22.296
listen to people,

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:25.800
and, most importantly,
be prepared to be amazed.

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:27.656
Thanks.

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:30.960
(Applause)